WEBVTT

01:40.490 --> 01:45.770
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.380 --> 01:50.650
[Episode 25]

02:11.030 --> 02:12.890
Is there a wish you'd like to make?

02:17.030 --> 02:17.870
Just once.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.760
Make a wish for yourself.

02:26.520 --> 02:28.360
My wish...

02:30.000 --> 02:31.150
is about you.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.400
I wish you

02:36.360 --> 02:37.190
safety

02:38.030 --> 02:38.890
and happiness.

02:43.030 --> 02:43.890
What about you?

02:48.680 --> 02:50.010
I wish to give you safety

02:51.190 --> 02:52.050
and happiness.

03:09.240 --> 03:11.680
I hope the one I love, Hongye,

03:10.420 --> 03:12.390
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

03:12.150 --> 03:12.910
will be happy

03:13.050 --> 03:15.510
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

03:13.750 --> 03:14.520
and safe.

03:15.430 --> 03:17.680
I hope the one I love, Huaizhu,

03:16.120 --> 03:19.840
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

03:19.280 --> 03:20.150
will be happy

03:20.990 --> 03:25.370
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

03:21.560 --> 03:22.400
and safe.

03:26.300 --> 03:30.340
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

03:31.430 --> 03:33.430
♪ We're fully committed ♪

03:33.970 --> 03:35.770
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

03:36.790 --> 03:40.520
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

03:41.370 --> 03:43.590
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

03:44.079 --> 03:46.460
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

03:47.590 --> 03:51.800
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

03:53.640 --> 03:58.079
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

03:58.720 --> 04:01.280
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

04:01.740 --> 04:03.700
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

04:04.470 --> 04:06.430
♪ Time goes by ♪

04:06.970 --> 04:09.030
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

04:09.690 --> 04:13.120
♪ But our love remains still ♪

04:14.650 --> 04:19.029
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

04:19.930 --> 04:22.490
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

04:23.200 --> 04:25.100
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

04:25.630 --> 04:27.300
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

04:28.040 --> 04:29.850
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

04:30.480 --> 04:34.070
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

04:55.880 --> 04:57.780
♪ We're fully committed ♪

04:58.420 --> 05:00.320
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

04:59.870 --> 05:00.680
Let's go.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.680
It won't be good if Huaizhu finds us.

05:01.240 --> 05:05.130
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

05:05.240 --> 05:06.120
Since we're already here,

05:05.590 --> 05:08.070
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

05:06.760 --> 05:08.360
why don't you make a wish too?

05:08.650 --> 05:10.820
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

05:09.560 --> 05:10.450
After all,

05:10.600 --> 05:11.560
Crescent Lake

05:11.800 --> 05:16.120
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

05:11.950 --> 05:13.860
doesn't turn full every day.

05:18.090 --> 05:22.530
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

05:20.920 --> 05:21.830
Let's go.

05:22.090 --> 05:23.330
Be quiet.

05:23.170 --> 05:25.590
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

05:26.190 --> 05:28.150
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

05:28.920 --> 05:30.870
♪ Time goes by ♪

05:31.710 --> 05:33.470
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

05:34.140 --> 05:37.520
♪ But our love remains still ♪

05:35.800 --> 05:37.060
What should I wish for?

05:38.830 --> 05:39.560
No.

05:39.100 --> 05:43.480
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

05:40.950 --> 05:43.010
How many wishes are you going to make?

05:44.159 --> 05:45.040
A thousand.

05:44.220 --> 05:46.770
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

05:45.370 --> 05:46.120
A thousand?

05:47.310 --> 05:49.320
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

05:49.630 --> 05:50.390
Hongye,

05:49.780 --> 05:51.700
♪ The past vanishes ♪

05:50.920 --> 05:51.720
Yitan,

05:52.010 --> 05:53.770
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

05:52.190 --> 05:53.150
Zizai...

05:54.550 --> 05:58.630
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

05:55.310 --> 05:57.140
As long as Huaizhu can be happy,

05:57.750 --> 06:00.160
I have no other wishes.

06:08.510 --> 06:09.270
Where is he?

06:11.920 --> 06:13.190
Puppy Li?

06:25.680 --> 06:26.920
This isn't good.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.190
If this keeps up,

06:29.560 --> 06:31.880
I'll end up betraying the masked sir.

06:34.790 --> 06:36.520
Why haven't they come back yet?

06:40.950 --> 06:42.310
You're quiet today.

06:42.830 --> 06:45.030
You're not waiting for them at the gate?

06:45.070 --> 06:47.530
Nothing good ever comes out of a dog's mouth.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.500
You've been drinking?

06:53.720 --> 06:55.740
Are you starting to waver?

06:55.870 --> 06:58.200
Do you think Hongye is not so bad after all?

07:01.120 --> 07:02.070
Come on.

07:03.270 --> 07:05.300
You haven't even seen what the leader of the Mask Group looks like.

07:05.300 --> 07:07.000
How can you be so unwavering?

07:07.190 --> 07:09.340
What if his face is full of pockmarks,

07:09.510 --> 07:11.070
and his nostrils are bigger than his eyes?

07:11.070 --> 07:12.870
Maybe that's why he wears a mask.

07:14.350 --> 07:15.200
Forget it.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.840
It's none of your business.

07:19.070 --> 07:19.930
That's enough.

07:20.510 --> 07:21.910
Is this not to your taste?

07:22.160 --> 07:23.360
I'll make something else for you.

07:23.360 --> 07:24.240
No need.

07:29.010 --> 07:30.210
It smells quite good.

07:31.270 --> 07:32.600
Can dogs drink alcohol?

07:33.430 --> 07:34.240
Why not?

07:57.830 --> 07:59.159
Hongye, Mrs. Wangquan,

07:59.159 --> 08:00.360
what are you doing?

08:01.430 --> 08:03.120
I owe what Huaizhu and I have today

08:03.120 --> 08:04.360
all to you, Quzhuo.

08:07.310 --> 08:08.110
Quzhuo,

08:10.390 --> 08:12.600
this drink is for you.

08:12.630 --> 08:14.270
When Huaizhu and I get married,

08:14.270 --> 08:16.560
you must sit at the main table.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.990
Sit at the main table?

08:20.160 --> 08:21.560
What an honor.

08:22.190 --> 08:23.250
Thank you, Hongye.

08:23.560 --> 08:24.750
Not only that.

08:24.830 --> 08:27.870
When we have children, we'll entrust them to your care.

08:27.870 --> 08:30.930
You're far more reliable than Yang Yitang and Li Zizai.

08:34.270 --> 08:35.470
When the child turns one month old,

08:35.470 --> 08:37.150
I want to sit at the main table too.

08:37.150 --> 08:38.000
No problem.

08:38.120 --> 08:41.320
Call me Brother Quzhuo and I'll take you to the main table.

08:42.030 --> 08:43.390
Brother Quzhuo!

08:44.610 --> 08:45.870
Sister Qinlan.

08:59.510 --> 09:01.710
I've been defeated by Wangquan Hongye.

09:02.000 --> 09:02.720
Tomorrow,

09:04.150 --> 09:05.680
I will leave Beast Kingdom.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.270
Do you even know

09:10.840 --> 09:12.000
what you're saying?

09:14.550 --> 09:16.210
I'm afraid you don't know yet,

09:16.630 --> 09:18.390
but the spy you planted in the Yiqi Alliance

09:18.390 --> 09:19.440
has been removed.

09:20.030 --> 09:21.830
The indenture no longer exists.

09:22.360 --> 09:24.510
Was it Wangquan Hongye who did it?

09:25.550 --> 09:26.620
So you're saying

09:26.790 --> 09:29.550
you're giving up the chance to become the world's greatest swordsman

09:29.550 --> 09:31.810
and plan to be Wangquan Hongye's lapdog?

09:32.670 --> 09:34.470
What path I'll take in the future

09:35.000 --> 09:36.060
and how I'll walk it

09:36.720 --> 09:38.050
is none of your concern.

09:38.550 --> 09:40.550
I have more than just the indenture.

09:41.960 --> 09:45.390
I also know where the remains of Young Master Zhang are.

09:46.750 --> 09:49.630
He was born with six toes on his left foot.

09:50.600 --> 09:52.960
As long as I make this secret public,

09:53.440 --> 09:56.870
everything you have will cease to exist.

10:02.550 --> 10:03.320
Go ahead.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.150
I don't care.

10:07.840 --> 10:09.270
What exactly has gotten into you?

10:09.270 --> 10:11.440
What kind of spell did Wangquan Hongye cast on you?

10:11.440 --> 10:12.870
He told me a lot of things.

10:14.510 --> 10:16.720
But it was one sentence from Dongfang Huaizhu

10:16.720 --> 10:18.000
that truly woke me up.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.030
What did she say?

10:21.200 --> 10:23.200
Young Master was such a good person.

10:23.630 --> 10:26.830
What he left for you before dying would never be shackles.

10:32.770 --> 10:34.470
A gentleman is like an orchid.

10:35.790 --> 10:38.170
I've helped evil, been coerced by you,

10:38.270 --> 10:39.730
and been wrong for so long.

10:41.360 --> 10:43.760
The Young Master gave me the chance to live,

10:45.270 --> 10:47.670
not for me to live in a dark, muddy pit,

10:47.840 --> 10:49.240
using any means to become

10:49.240 --> 10:51.700
the so-called world's greatest swordsman.

10:52.750 --> 10:54.010
Go ahead and expose it.

10:54.910 --> 10:56.770
If the Zhang family wants me dead,

10:58.270 --> 10:59.470
I'll pay with my life.

11:00.720 --> 11:01.440
Only then

11:04.240 --> 11:05.930
can I say I didn't fail him.

11:26.570 --> 11:29.900
This is the latest developed demon-controlling talisman.

11:30.840 --> 11:33.370
It doesn't need to be ingested to take effect.

11:33.600 --> 11:36.090
You put a sub-talisman on me?

11:36.360 --> 11:37.750
To be honest,

11:37.770 --> 11:40.270
I've already fed you demon poison.

11:40.870 --> 11:42.530
Since you're so disobedient,

11:43.000 --> 11:46.270
I can only use a demon-controlling talisman to control you,

11:46.270 --> 11:48.910
turning you into the most powerful demon,

11:49.000 --> 11:50.580
to be used by me

11:50.630 --> 11:51.930
and remain my slave for life!

11:51.930 --> 11:54.390
How could there be a mother like you in this world?

11:54.390 --> 11:55.670
You forced me!

12:53.570 --> 12:56.700
How could you not have been affected by the demon poison?

12:57.010 --> 12:58.230
This is impossible.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.040
Impossible.

13:11.630 --> 13:12.520
Guards!

13:13.240 --> 13:14.440
Guards!

13:15.320 --> 13:16.530
Kill him!

13:19.250 --> 13:20.650
You're asking for death!

14:31.790 --> 14:34.030
Jin Renfeng? Why are you here?

14:35.510 --> 14:37.910
I'm here on behalf of Lord Jiuhuo to ask you,

14:38.240 --> 14:39.750
when will you get

14:39.930 --> 14:41.530
the Twilight Mist Flower?

14:43.000 --> 14:44.720
This has nothing to do with you.

14:44.720 --> 14:45.510
You'd better mind

14:45.510 --> 14:47.240
your own business.

14:47.760 --> 14:51.400
You want to keep the Twilight Mist Flower for yourself?

14:51.670 --> 14:52.750
So what if I do?

14:53.150 --> 14:54.440
And so what if I don't?

14:54.840 --> 14:57.000
You're overstepping your bounds.

15:01.440 --> 15:02.720
Stop pretending.

15:03.550 --> 15:05.600
You and I are the same kind of people.

15:06.000 --> 15:07.450
We submitted to Jiuhuo

15:07.550 --> 15:10.280
only because we wanted to use him and the Black Fox

15:10.440 --> 15:11.960
to climb higher.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.200
Don't worry.

15:24.560 --> 15:27.510
Once the next round of Drunken Dream Tower's demon selection is over,

15:27.510 --> 15:30.270
I'll give Lord Jiuhuo an explanation.

15:43.080 --> 15:44.120
My Lady.

15:45.720 --> 15:46.770
My Lady,

15:47.250 --> 15:49.120
we've used all the most precious antidotes

15:49.120 --> 15:50.320
in our Ruyi Pavilion,

15:50.720 --> 15:53.320
but the demon poison in your body still hasn't been removed—

15:53.320 --> 15:55.050
only temporarily suppressed.

15:55.150 --> 15:56.750
You're taking too big a risk.

15:59.870 --> 16:01.530
At least we've suppressed it.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.510
When I get back,

16:06.120 --> 16:08.520
with the wealth and power of Ruyi Pavilion,

16:09.120 --> 16:11.180
we can definitely find the catalyst.

16:11.750 --> 16:15.230
So after you and Master Zhang exchanged blood,

16:15.360 --> 16:17.200
you just left him in the desert?

16:19.440 --> 16:20.320
Don't worry.

16:21.540 --> 16:22.630
He won't die.

16:23.350 --> 16:24.280
Wait.

16:24.320 --> 16:26.190
You've done so much for him.

16:26.240 --> 16:27.840
Shouldn't you tell him?

16:32.270 --> 16:34.510
I'm not someone who serves in silence.

16:36.870 --> 16:38.520
I just don't want to tell him.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.750
The shackles on him

16:43.790 --> 16:45.240
are heavy enough.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.200
My Lady.

16:49.600 --> 16:51.730
Besides, I already know his feelings.

16:53.150 --> 16:54.680
Once we deal with his mother

16:56.150 --> 16:58.210
and the demon poison in me is removed,

17:00.720 --> 17:02.250
I won't let him off the hook.

17:07.349 --> 17:11.710
[Demon Tamer No. 3: Tuoba Lie, second son of the Tuoba family, age 31, 8 years as a demon tamer]

17:09.829 --> 17:13.030
In 4 days, the Drunken Dream Tower will hold a Demon Fight.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.560
This is all the information we have on them.

17:16.270 --> 17:19.900
Hongye, if you're really going to participate,

17:19.960 --> 17:21.109
you must be very careful.

17:21.109 --> 17:22.839
It's not to be underestimated.

17:23.010 --> 17:23.750
Alright.

17:24.270 --> 17:25.240
Qingmu,

17:25.790 --> 17:29.160
have you made up with that man in black with the black sword?

17:30.830 --> 17:33.690
Thank you all again for what you did for Zhang Zheng.

17:34.510 --> 17:36.800
All right, I've delivered the message.

17:36.920 --> 17:38.030
I'll head back now.

17:44.010 --> 17:45.140
Qingmu?

17:49.310 --> 17:50.570
What's wrong with you?

17:50.680 --> 17:53.810
It's nothing. I've probably just been too tired lately.

17:56.920 --> 17:58.780
You got poisoned by demon poison?

17:59.640 --> 18:00.970
Because of Zhang Zheng?

18:02.720 --> 18:04.270
Even a fool can see that.

18:04.350 --> 18:05.640
Who else could it be?

18:05.890 --> 18:08.960
Please, don't tell Zhang Zheng about this.

18:10.240 --> 18:13.170
I want him to figure out his feelings for me on his own.

18:13.270 --> 18:16.570
I don't want to use this as leverage to force him.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.030
Don't worry.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.390
I'm not that fragile.

18:25.200 --> 18:28.000
You should focus on preparing for the Demon Fight.

18:28.030 --> 18:29.640
We must win this time.

18:31.750 --> 18:32.430
Quzhuo,

18:33.310 --> 18:36.770
make a magical artifact to counter demon poison immediately.

18:40.920 --> 18:47.090
[Drunken Dream Tower]

18:48.210 --> 18:50.570
[Demon Fight]

18:50.030 --> 18:51.930
How does it feel standing here?

18:52.720 --> 18:55.180
Which number did you place your bet on?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.130
What about you guys?

18:58.880 --> 18:59.720
Catch these!

19:07.280 --> 19:09.420
Puppy Li, they are over there!

19:13.510 --> 19:15.950
Esteemed guests and demon tamers!

19:17.510 --> 19:20.000
You're too enthusiastic!

19:20.920 --> 19:26.310
Tonight is another good night for everyone to get drunk!

19:27.830 --> 19:29.510
Alright, alright, alright.

19:30.770 --> 19:34.100
The profiles of the participating demon tamers for tonight

19:34.160 --> 19:36.920
have been sent to you.

19:37.110 --> 19:39.850
You can now

19:39.920 --> 19:41.610
place your bets!

19:42.880 --> 19:45.520
Next, all demon tamers,

19:45.680 --> 19:47.560
please bring your demons

19:47.590 --> 19:49.650
to the stage.

19:50.350 --> 19:54.550
Get on stage! Get on stage!

19:56.170 --> 19:57.590
Please get on the stage!

19:58.400 --> 19:59.120
Let's go.

20:00.310 --> 20:01.200
Good!

20:01.770 --> 20:03.140
Let's go. We're up next.

20:12.750 --> 20:14.750
The winner of today's Demon Fight

20:14.830 --> 20:17.720
will not only receive an additional reward—an audience with the owner—

20:17.720 --> 20:20.610
but will also become the owner's right-hand man,

20:20.790 --> 20:23.990
enjoying a lifetime of glory and wealth.

20:24.040 --> 20:27.660
However, the rules of today's Demon Fight

20:28.790 --> 20:31.460
have changed.

20:32.430 --> 20:36.560
Today, the Demon Fight will no longer be a one-on-one battle.

20:36.610 --> 20:42.080
Instead, all demon tamers will enter an illusion together.

20:42.240 --> 20:45.450
The one who obtains the treasure will be the winner.

20:45.480 --> 20:47.400
Bravo!

20:47.470 --> 20:49.440
Treasure? What is it?

20:50.680 --> 20:53.060
You'll know once you enter the illusion.

20:53.270 --> 20:55.000
So getting the treasure counts as winning?

20:55.000 --> 20:55.720
Yes.

20:55.960 --> 20:57.960
Regardless of the means or methods?

20:57.960 --> 20:59.960
Regardless of the means or methods.

21:00.440 --> 21:02.770
Life and death are not restricted either.

21:03.530 --> 21:04.160
Alright!

21:08.310 --> 21:09.510
National Preceptor,

21:09.720 --> 21:12.710
this pair of sisters seem a bit strange.

21:13.830 --> 21:15.490
They are indeed a bit strange.

21:16.750 --> 21:17.830
But perhaps

21:18.400 --> 21:21.860
they're the ones who can help me find the Twilight Mist Flower.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.500
Tell them to get ready.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.790
Once they succeed...

21:26.640 --> 21:27.370
Understood.

21:28.270 --> 21:29.670
Kill them without mercy.

21:29.960 --> 21:34.200
The Demon Fight formation is activated!

21:51.000 --> 21:53.000
With the convergence of earth veins

21:53.570 --> 21:55.590
and abundant spiritual energy here,

21:55.590 --> 21:58.160
it's indeed an ideal place for spiritual flowers and rare beasts to grow.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.760
Where are Qinlan and Quzhuo?

22:45.830 --> 22:47.090
Don't come any closer!

23:39.330 --> 23:41.030
Leaving this place

23:41.630 --> 23:43.470
won't be that easy.

24:10.240 --> 24:12.710
Heroine, don't let go!

24:13.000 --> 24:15.980
Fly higher!

24:17.510 --> 24:18.850
Stop nagging!

24:19.070 --> 24:20.480
If you keep making noise, I'll throw both of you down!

24:20.480 --> 24:22.070
Qinlan, stop making noise!

24:22.270 --> 24:23.510
I can't hold on much longer!

24:23.510 --> 24:26.670
I'm not the one making noise! It's them!

24:29.440 --> 24:30.590
Who are you?

24:30.960 --> 24:32.310
Why are you hiding?

24:33.110 --> 24:35.930
I am the master of this place,

24:36.240 --> 24:38.830
the one who holds your fate in my hands.

24:39.070 --> 24:41.460
You're all going to die.

24:43.830 --> 24:46.480
But I'll give you a chance to live.

24:47.000 --> 24:49.640
Before the encirclement closes in,

24:50.350 --> 24:54.160
if one group among you kills another,

24:55.110 --> 24:56.920
they'll survive.

24:57.440 --> 24:58.970
Why should we listen to you?

25:01.310 --> 25:04.000
As if you have a choice.

25:09.240 --> 25:11.010
Either get killed,

25:11.250 --> 25:13.580
or all of you die.

25:14.350 --> 25:15.390
Kill them.

25:52.320 --> 25:54.420
Dongfang Divine Fire?

25:56.750 --> 25:59.070
She's actually Dongfang Huaizhu?

25:59.070 --> 26:00.000
National Preceptor,

26:00.000 --> 26:02.310
if she really is Dongfang Huaizhu,

26:02.960 --> 26:04.480
then who's her demon?

26:08.200 --> 26:09.600
Hurry to the Grand Palace

26:10.200 --> 26:11.510
and request an audience with the ruler.

26:11.510 --> 26:12.350
Yes.

26:24.510 --> 26:26.160
Tuoba Yin got eliminated?

26:26.180 --> 26:27.830
Indeed. So useless.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.110
He fell.

26:33.260 --> 26:34.630
He's dead.

26:35.620 --> 26:37.480
I actually had high hopes for him.

26:37.550 --> 26:38.850
I never expected that

26:39.160 --> 26:41.470
Tuoba Yin, the strongest of them all,

26:41.670 --> 26:43.990
was eliminated too.

26:44.350 --> 26:47.310
But his demon is still in the illusion.

26:48.350 --> 26:50.110
Distinguished guests,

26:50.240 --> 26:52.070
what do you think we should do?

26:52.160 --> 26:55.440
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

26:55.470 --> 26:58.330
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

26:58.360 --> 27:01.340
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

27:01.370 --> 27:04.590
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

27:04.620 --> 27:07.460
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

27:07.490 --> 27:11.910
Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!

27:16.830 --> 27:18.430
Thank you for saving my life.

27:33.430 --> 27:39.120
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

27:44.630 --> 27:47.290
Heroine, I really can't hold on any longer.

27:47.350 --> 27:48.160
Qinlan,

27:48.770 --> 27:50.270
I can't hold on either!

27:54.960 --> 28:00.210
You two must hold on, even if you can't!

28:15.270 --> 28:16.200
Qinlan.

28:18.260 --> 28:20.450
I have one last thing to say to you.

28:20.590 --> 28:21.510
Say it!

28:23.240 --> 28:24.580
I...

28:28.680 --> 28:29.720
Interesting.

28:32.110 --> 28:33.910
Finally, after such a long time,

28:34.270 --> 28:36.440
here comes a pair of kind-hearted

28:36.560 --> 28:37.960
and intelligent people.

28:38.750 --> 28:39.990
Congratulations.

28:40.160 --> 28:42.590
You may enter the next round of my game

28:42.830 --> 28:44.740
and face my judgment.
Judgment?

28:45.240 --> 28:46.070
Judgment?

28:46.720 --> 28:48.070
The Twilight Mist Flower

28:48.070 --> 28:50.590
belongs only to those of the purest goodness.

28:50.590 --> 28:52.070
I will judge

28:52.200 --> 28:53.800
whether you are purely good.

28:55.070 --> 28:56.270
There is no such thing

28:56.550 --> 28:58.310
as pure goodness in this world.

28:59.720 --> 29:02.070
Then do you dare to accept my judgment?

29:20.960 --> 29:24.200
You have soul shards of the Black Fox within you.

29:25.310 --> 29:27.640
This soul is utterly evil.

29:28.200 --> 29:29.070
Yes.

29:29.550 --> 29:31.350
Though you have suppressed her,

29:31.830 --> 29:34.170
she still resides in your blood,

29:34.270 --> 29:36.600
drawing power from your Spiritual Blood.

29:36.720 --> 29:38.060
One day,

29:38.200 --> 29:40.350
she will rise again.

29:40.590 --> 29:41.640
I know.

29:42.590 --> 29:45.850
The Twilight Mist Flower is the purest flower in the world.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.440
If you obtain me,

29:47.750 --> 29:50.460
you can forever suppress the Black Fox.

29:52.920 --> 29:55.520
So this is the backup plan my mother left for me?

29:56.720 --> 29:58.110
Don't you hate her?

29:58.640 --> 30:00.000
Everything she did

30:00.720 --> 30:02.070
must have had a reason.

30:03.040 --> 30:04.680
Dongfang Huaizhu,

30:05.270 --> 30:08.160
you can indeed be considered good.

30:24.880 --> 30:26.240
But the person beside you

30:26.240 --> 30:27.900
has killed countless people.

30:27.920 --> 30:31.310
has killed countless times. His sword is stained with countless lives.

30:31.310 --> 30:33.020
Wangquan Hongye,

30:33.110 --> 30:35.070
I judge you as evil.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.640
So smart.

30:43.400 --> 30:47.330
You immediately thought that the Twilight Mist Flower could help you.

30:47.550 --> 30:49.920
But the cost is high.

30:51.070 --> 30:52.400
If you can't awaken him,

30:53.160 --> 30:55.310
you'll die with him.

31:22.270 --> 31:24.580
[Young Wangquan Hongye]

31:30.380 --> 31:32.040
Hand over the Wangquan Sword,

31:32.310 --> 31:33.830
and I'll spare your life.

31:37.070 --> 31:38.350
Hongye!

31:39.510 --> 31:40.160
Hongye!

31:40.160 --> 31:41.000
Zui!

31:42.510 --> 31:43.880
Hongye!

31:46.310 --> 31:50.070
You actually betrayed Wangquan Manor as well.

31:53.310 --> 31:54.590
Kill him!

32:11.480 --> 32:13.400
I'll kill you all!

32:45.090 --> 32:46.910
Zui, Zui!

32:51.640 --> 32:53.230
Wangquan Hongye,

32:56.050 --> 32:58.180
you must protect Zui

33:01.180 --> 33:04.780
and Wangquan Manor!

33:07.160 --> 33:09.640
You all deserve to die.

33:10.070 --> 33:12.090
I'll kill you all!

33:12.640 --> 33:13.720
Wangquan Hongye.

33:14.440 --> 33:16.700
those who betrayed you are already dead.

33:16.830 --> 33:18.690
Wangquan Zui will grow up safely.

33:19.270 --> 33:21.930
You have the ability to protect Wangquan Manor.

33:22.960 --> 33:25.050
I will kill them all!

33:25.070 --> 33:25.510
I will definitely...

33:25.510 --> 33:29.110
You will definitely be able to protect the people you care about.

33:29.240 --> 33:30.700
Because you're not alone.

34:19.510 --> 34:20.880
Am I dreaming?

34:21.719 --> 34:22.679
Who are you?

34:25.690 --> 34:26.480
Remember,

34:28.480 --> 34:31.440
you have never been alone.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.230
Huaizhu,

34:48.730 --> 34:50.010
what happened?

34:50.909 --> 34:53.360
Just now, your primordial spirit left your body,

34:53.360 --> 34:56.290
and you were at the closest point to becoming a demon.

34:56.550 --> 34:57.320
So?

34:57.840 --> 34:59.280
I was right, wasn't I?

34:59.670 --> 35:01.920
There is indeed evil in his heart.

35:02.960 --> 35:06.110
If the flower spirit had been so arbitrary in judging good and evil,

35:06.110 --> 35:07.800
it wouldn't have given me the chance

35:07.800 --> 35:09.730
to enter Hongye's consciousness.

35:10.840 --> 35:11.980
Very good.

35:12.440 --> 35:14.110
I like smart people.

35:16.880 --> 35:17.840
Not just for me.

35:18.230 --> 35:19.560
If it were someone else,

35:19.790 --> 35:22.150
my Huaizhu would still step forward.

35:23.360 --> 35:24.960
Because she is just that kind

35:27.070 --> 35:28.070
of good person.

35:50.670 --> 35:52.070
I'm dead?

35:58.070 --> 36:00.380
Where am I, Qinlan?

36:03.070 --> 36:04.550
Qinlan?

36:06.510 --> 36:07.710
Li Quzhuo,

36:08.360 --> 36:10.780
Get off me!

36:14.400 --> 36:15.920
Dongfang Huaizhu,

36:16.070 --> 36:18.440
your mother, Jiang Juanxue, was right.

36:19.000 --> 36:22.440
You are indeed qualified to be the master of the Twilight Mist Flower.

36:22.440 --> 36:24.550
You've passed my test.

36:26.400 --> 36:27.460
My mother...

36:27.710 --> 36:29.070
has been here before?

36:29.480 --> 36:30.360
Yes.

36:31.190 --> 36:32.510
Do you want to see her?

36:33.590 --> 36:34.110
Huaizhu!

36:34.110 --> 36:34.630
Hongye!

36:36.230 --> 36:36.800
Qinlan.

36:37.800 --> 36:38.190
How are you?

36:38.190 --> 36:38.880
Quzhuo.

36:38.960 --> 36:40.070
-Are you hurt?
-Are you okay?

36:40.070 --> 36:41.230
It was too dangerous.

36:41.230 --> 36:43.360
Is she also Jiang Juanxue's daughter?

36:43.710 --> 36:45.570
Are you the Twilight Mist Flower?

36:45.800 --> 36:47.760
How does it know our mother's name?

36:48.000 --> 36:50.860
The Twilight Mist Flower is the purest in the world,

36:51.290 --> 36:52.890
born with the earth's veins.

36:53.800 --> 36:55.760
I am the spirit of the Twilight Mist Flower,

36:55.760 --> 36:59.510
but I have never been able to grow into a mature Twilight Mist Flower.

36:59.510 --> 37:01.330
Ten years ago,

37:01.400 --> 37:04.440
your mother, Jiang Juanxue, came here.

37:05.190 --> 37:08.960
She said she was willing to give up all her spiritual energy and her life

37:08.960 --> 37:11.440
to help me fully mature within ten years.

37:12.280 --> 37:15.360
She truly endured great suffering for this.

37:15.380 --> 37:19.480
When she left this place, she was almost drained of everything.

37:20.400 --> 37:23.290
I thought I had met the purest goodness in the world.

37:23.710 --> 37:25.480
But she was cunning and deceitful,

37:25.480 --> 37:26.710
setting up a barrier

37:26.930 --> 37:28.610
to trap me here

37:28.800 --> 37:30.260
and making me wait for you.

37:31.150 --> 37:33.000
Both her goodness and evil

37:33.110 --> 37:34.670
were because of you.

37:35.590 --> 37:37.570
So, is the word "daughter"

37:37.760 --> 37:39.610
really that important?

37:39.880 --> 37:43.240
This is a question I've never been able to understand.

37:43.440 --> 37:46.240
That's why I left a little of her spiritual energy,

37:46.280 --> 37:48.550
so she could speak to you herself.

37:48.630 --> 37:49.800
Follow me.

38:15.070 --> 38:15.820
You...

38:15.840 --> 38:16.630
Move aside!

38:17.360 --> 38:18.520
By order of the King!

38:18.590 --> 38:20.710
All unauthorized personnel, leave immediately!

38:20.710 --> 38:21.150
Leave!

38:21.240 --> 38:21.890
Go, go!

38:21.960 --> 38:23.280
-Leave!
-Leave!
